OL,3,ADozens arrested in Paris as day of
OL,4,Aprotests begins across France
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday's demonstrations come after three
OL,7,Fweeks of student protests across the
OL,8,Fcountry, with calls for students to be
OL,9,Fjoined by workers' unions and key
OL,10,Ffigures from the so-called "yellow
OL,11,Fvest" movement
OL,13,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron has
OL,14,Fappealed for "calm", calling on
OL,15,Fdemonstrators to show "respect for
OL,16,Fpeople and property"
OL,18,FThe gilets jaunes (yellow vests)
OL,19,Fdemonstrated against cost-of-living
OL,20,Fhikes for over a year from 2018 -
OL,21,Fbecoming one of the longest-lived
OL,22,Fprotest movements in French history
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
